		(descr "ADP150AUJZ (ultralow-noise LDO, per datasheets/extracted/ev-radar-mmic2.md BOM: U4=ADP150AUJZ-3.0 feeds AVDD_PLL, U5=ADP150AUJZ-1.8 feeds DVDD_PLL for ADF4159). Package: 5-Lead TSOT (=SOT-23-5 equivalent thin outline), confirmed via ADI ADP150 datasheet pin configuration search: Pin1=VIN, Pin2=GND, Pin3=EN, Pin4=NC, Pin5=VOUT. Land pattern modeled on KiCad stock Package_TO_SOT_SMD.pretty/TSOT-23-5.kicad_mod (pad 1.325x0.6mm, 0.95mm pitch) - standard SOT-23-5 JEDEC land, no ADI-specific deviation found for this small SOT variant.")
